# Default deny: only reviewed server build/runtime inputs enter the context.
**
!Server/pyproject.toml
!Server/uv.lock
!Server/README.md
!Server/LICENSE
!Server/src/
!Server/src/**
!MCPForUnity/package.json

# Exclusions stay last so nested local state cannot override the allowlist.
**/.*
**/.*/**
**/.env*
**/.git
**/.work
**/.tmp
**/.codex
**/.agents
**/.venv
**/venv
**/venv/**
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.DS_Store
